.TH QUADRF-TX-UNLOCK 8 "August 2026" "QuadRF" "QuadRF"
.SH NAME
quadrf-tx-unlock \- record acceptance of the TX lawful-use notice
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B quadrf-tx-unlock
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates
.I /var/lib/quadrf/tx_full_power
so
.BR quadrf-jtag (1)
will program MAX2850 TX gain above 40. Until that file exists, gain is
capped at 40 on all four transmit channels.
.PP
The web control panel invokes this through the sudoers rule in
.IR /etc/sudoers.d/quadrf
after the operator agrees to the notice on the Controls page.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/quadrf/tx_full_power
Presence of this file unlocks full TX gain. Remove it to restore the cap.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR quadrf-jtag (1),
.BR quadrf (1)
